    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      439.45,
      116.74,
      462.28
    ],
    "text": "Colombo,25th March 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      268.65,
      474.49,
      318.81,
      485.56
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      498.01,
      539.84,
      520.6
    ],
    "text": "The Insurance Board Regulations, 2005 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1414/19 of October 12,2005 arehereby amended by the repeal of regulation 3 thereof and the substiution therefor of the following :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      533.05,
      308.74,
      544.12
    ],
    "text": "\u201c3. An insurer shall pay to the Board as an annual fee\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      97.29,
      556.33,
      434.72,
      567.4
    ],
    "text": "(a) a sum of rupees one hundred thousand for the first calendar year of operation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      113.85,
      579.85,
      539.89,
      614.2
    ],
    "text": "Provided however that, any insurer who is required to comply with Section 53 of the Regulation of InsuranceIndustry (Amendment) Act, No. 3 of 2011, shall pay to the Board as an annual fee 0.10% of the gross writtenpremium for the first calendar year of operation ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      96.57,
      626.65,
      450.72,
      637.72
    ],
    "text": "(b) from and after the date of commencement of the second calendar year of operation -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      123.69,
      649.93,
      445.21,
      661.0
    ],
    "text": "(i) a sum of rupees two hundred thousand in respect of insurance business ; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      121.29,
      673.45,
      497.02,
      684.52
    ],
    "text": "(ii) 0.10% of the gross written premium of insurance business of the preceding financial year,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      113.85,
      696.73,
      233.88,
      707.8
    ],
    "text": "whichever amount is higher.\u201d.",
